<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Triangle Community Resources – printable flyer</title>
<style>
@page{size:letter;margin:.5in}
*{box-sizing:border-box}
body{margin:0;font:16px/1.4 ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,"Segoe UI",Roboto,sans-serif;color:#1f1d1a;background:#fff}
.sheet{max-width:7.5in;margin:0 auto;padding:.4in 0;text-align:center}
h1{font:800 2.6rem/1.05 Georgia,"Iowan Old Style",serif;margin:0 0 .4rem}
.lead{font-size:1.35rem;margin:0 0 1.2rem}
.lead.es{font-size:1.1rem;color:#5d5850;margin-top:-.8rem}
img.qr{width:4.2in;height:4.2in;display:block;margin:0 auto}
.url{font:600 1.05rem/1.3 ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace;margin:.6rem 0 1.2rem;word-break:break-all}
ul{list-style:none;padding:0;margin:0 auto 1.2rem;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:center;gap:.4rem .6rem;max-width:6.8in}
li{border:1.5px solid #1f1d1a;border-radius:999px;padding:.15rem .7rem;font-size:1rem}
.foot{font-size:.95rem;color:#5d5850}
.crisis{margin-top:1rem;font-weight:700;font-size:1.05rem}
.noprint{margin:1rem 0}
@media print{.noprint{display:none}}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="sheet">
  <h1>Help near you</h1>
  <p class="lead">Free and low-cost food, clothing, shelter, showers, health care, mutual aid and more across the Triangle. Scan to see what's open in your town.</p>
  <p class="lead es">Comida, ropa, refugio y más, gratis o de bajo costo, en el Triángulo. Escanee el código.</p>
  <img class="qr" src="qr.svg" alt="QR code linking to {{ url }}">
  <div class="url">{{ url_short }}</div>
  <ul>{% for c, em in needs %}<li>{{ em }} {{ c }}</li>{% endfor %}</ul>
  <p class="foot">{{ total }} free and community-run resources in Durham, Raleigh, Chapel Hill, Carrboro, Hillsborough, Cary, Pittsboro and nearby towns. Updated every day.</p>
  <p class="crisis">In crisis? Call or text 988 · Find services: dial 211</p>
  <p class="noprint"><button onclick="window.print()">Print this flyer</button></p>
</div>
</body>
</html>
